# Nested repository with its own remote (Dharma-Poshanam/swadharma-service-management).
# Tracked there, not here — an accidental `git add -A` turns it into a gitlink
# that clones of this repo cannot resolve.
swadharma-service-management/

# Student rosters are personal data and must never enter the repository.
# The Dockerfile copies only *.html and *.css, so this folder is not published
# by a deploy — but it sits in the deploy directory, one `git add .` away from
# being committed to a remote. Ignored so that cannot happen by accident.
swadharmaservices.in/Edu/
